6-b072-42f9-9191-e29f58db4249","isGlobalTemplate":false},"content":{"text":{"htmlDescription":"<p style=\"font-size:.8rem !important;line-height:1.4 !important;color:#666;margin:6px 0 0\">KI-generiertes Bild</p>","textAlignment":"left","color":""},"button":{"label":"","link":"","variant":"primary"},"layout":{"backgroundColor":"","paddingTop":0,"paddingBottom":0,"paddingLeft":0,"paddingRight":0}},"parent_slot":0,"slot_index":1},{"name":"TextCard","type":"content","meta":{"uuid":"d0d0cf29-8ae0-4d57-a98d-b97aa2f9ba75","isGlobalTemplate":false},"content":{"text":{"htmlDescription":"<p style=\"margin:0 0 14px\">Bei klassischem Schuhwerk richtet sich die Länge nach der Zahl der Ösenpaare:</p><div style=\"overflow-x:auto\"><table style=\"width:100%;border-collapse:collapse;font-size:1em !important;line-height:1.5 !important;margin:0;border:0\"><thead><tr><th scope=\"col\" style=\"background:#4C595D;color:#fff;text-align:left;font-weight:600;padding:12px 16px;border:0;font-size:1em !important\">Ösenpaare</th><th scope=\"col\" style=\"background:#4C595D;color:#fff;text-align:left;font-weight:600;padding:12px 16px;border:0;font-size:1em !important\">Länge</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td style=\"padding:12px 16px;border:0;border-bottom:1px solid #D6D3CD;white-space:nowrap;font-size:1em !important;line-height:1.5 !important;background:#fff;font-weight:600;\">1–2</td><td style=\"padding:12px 16px;border:0;border-bottom:1px solid #D6D3CD;white-space:nowrap;font-size:1em !important;line-height:1.5 !important;background:#fff;\">45 cm</td></tr><tr><td style=\"padding:12px 16px;border:0;border-bottom:1px solid #D6D3CD;white-space:nowrap;font-size:1em !important;line-height:1.5 !important;background:#F6F5F2;font-weight:600;\">3–4</td><td style=\"padding:12px 16px;border:0;border-bottom:1px solid #D6D3CD;white-space:nowrap;font-size:1em !important;line-height:1.5 !important;background:#F6F5F2;\">60 cm</td></tr><tr><td style=\"padding:12px 16px;border:0;border-bottom:1px solid #D6D3CD;white-space:nowrap;font-size:1em !important;line-height:1.5 !important;background:#fff;font-weight:600;\">4–5</td><td style=\"padding:12px 16px;border:0;border-bottom:1px solid #D6D3CD;white-space:nowrap;font-size:1em !important;line-height:1.5 !important;background:#fff;\">75 cm</td></tr><tr><td style=\"padding:12px 16px;border:0;border-bottom:1px solid #D6D3CD;white-space:nowrap;font-size:1em !important;line-height:1.5 !important;background:#F6F5F2;font-weight:600;\">5–6</td><td style=\"padding:12px 16px;border:0;border-bottom:1px solid #D6D3CD;white-space:nowrap;font-size:1em !important;line-height:1.5 !important;background:#F6F5F2;\">90 cm</td></tr><tr><td style=\"padding:12px 16px;border:0;border-bottom:1px solid #D6D3CD;white-space:nowrap;font-size:1em !important;line-height:1.5 !important;background:#fff;font-weight:600;\">7–8</td><td style=\"padding:12px 16px;border:0;border-bottom:1px solid #D6D3CD;white-space:nowrap;font-size:1em !important;line-height:1.5 !important;background:#fff;\">120 cm</td></tr><tr><td style=\"padding:12px 16px;border:0;border-bottom:1px solid #D6D3CD;white-space:nowrap;font-size:1em !important;line-height:1.5 !important;background:#F6F5F2;font-weight:600;\">ab 9 / Stiefel</td><td style=\"padding:12px 16px;border:0;border-bottom:1px solid #D6D3CD;white-space:nowrap;font-size:1em !important;line-height:1.5 !important;background:#F6F5F2;\">150–180 cm</td></tr></tbody></table></div>","textAlignment":"left","color":""},"button":{"label":"","link":"","variant":"primary"},"layout":{"backgroundColor":"","paddingTop":0,"paddingBottom":0,"paddingLeft":0,"paddingRight":0}},"parent_slot":1}]},{"name":"MultiGrid","type":"structure","meta":{"uuid":"90c22b5a-3e6b-44ce-b415-61b0a6c3ca43","isGlobalTemplate":false},"configuration":{"columnWidths":[6,6],"layout":{"gap":"L","marginTop":0,"marginBottom":0,"backgroundColor":"transparent"},"visible":true},"content":[{"name":"TextCard","type":"content","meta":{"uuid":"76acd6a2-6724-4cbd-86a6-21eb9b84619b","isGlobalTemplate":false},"content":{"text":{"htmlDescription":"<h3 class=\"mt-4\">Für welche Schuhe die Faustregel gilt</h3><p>Die Faustregel gilt für klassisches Schuhwerk. Je weiter die Ösen auseinanderliegen, wie bei Sneakern oder Boots, desto weniger passt sie. Sneaker haben meist viele Lochpaare und brauchen 90–120 cm. Eine Stiefelette braucht ab 120 cm, kniehohe Damenstiefel meist 150 bis 180 cm.</p>","textAlignment":"left","color":""},"button":{"label":"","link":"","variant":"primary"},"layout":{"backgroundColor":"","paddingTop":0,"paddingBottom":0,"paddingLeft":0,"paddingRight":0}},"parent_slot":0},{"name":"TextCard","type":"content","meta":{"uuid":"6f5cf0f1-db21-462f-a27b-7c9a68fe45b7","isGlobalTemplate":false},"content":{"text":{"htmlDescription":"<h3>Zwischen zwei Längen?</h3><p>Bei 4 und 5 Ösenpaaren nennt die Tabelle zwei Längen. Ob die kürzere oder die längere passt, hängt vom Schuh und vom Fuß ab: Ein 5-Loch-Derby oder -Oxford aus dem klassischen Segment braucht fast immer 75 cm, bei kräftigem Fuß 90 cm. Auch die Schnürart und der Fußtyp spielen mit, und ein dicker Senkel wie der F6-XR braucht etwas mehr Länge als ein dünner.</p>","textAlignment":"left","color":""},"button":{"label":"","link":"","variant":"primary"},"layout":{"backgroundColor":"","paddingTop":0,"paddingBottom":0,"paddingLeft":0,"paddingRight":0}},"parent_slot":1}]},{"name":"TextCard","type":"content","meta":{"uuid":"6ca1c0a1-4549-4483-931f-80682f97b468","isGlobalTemplate":false},"content":{"text":{"htmlDescription":"<div style=\"overflow-x:auto\"><table style=\"width:100%;border-collapse:collapse;font-size:1em !important;line-height:1.5 !important;margin:0;border:0\"><thead><tr><th scope=\"col\" style=\"background:#4C595D;color:#fff;text-align:left;font-weight:600;padding:12px 16px;border:0;font-size:1em !important\">Serie</th><th scope=\"col\" style=\"background:#4C595D;color:#fff;text-align:left;font-weight:600;padding:12px 16px;border:0;font-size:1em !important\">Form</th><th scop